{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmeUmMJq4KSsYLSpv51U","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll put it simply: if the money stays in the עו\"ש, it shrinks. The page's example was 10,000 ₪ sitting there for 10 years, which comes to \"בעו\"ש שווים ₪8,203 בכסף של היום\", so \"₪1,797 פחות\". Mine is 30,000, so I lose more, probably about three times that. The page didn't show me my own figure. I'm fairly sure of it, and the one thing that decided it was that 8,203 under 10,000.\n\n**Where I looked, in order**\n- **Top:** the heading \"חשבון עובר ושב\" and the line under it, \"כסף שיושב בו לא תמיד מקבל ריבית\". OK, that's my situation.\n- **\"מה זה\":** I read the first lines. Not every bank pays interest. I noticed 15,000 ₪, which I think is the amount where they have to send you a notice. The rest I didn't read.\n- **\"למה משתמשים בזה\":** I scrolled past it.\n- **\"כמה עולה להשאיר כסף בעו\"ש?\":** this is the part I came for. 10,000 ₪, 10 years, 8,203, 1,797 less. There's a \"יתרה בעו\"ש\" field set to 10,000. I'd want to put 30,000 in it, but in what I have it stays at 10,000, so I never saw my own number.\n- **The chart:** a yellow line going up for \"בקרן כספית\", a light line going down for \"בעו\"ש\", and a brown area marked \"המחיר של להשאיר ₪2,576\". The small text says prices go up 2% a year (that part I understood) and the fund \"3.25%\".\n- **Second calculator, \"מה קורה לכסף לאורך הזמן\":** a huge 62,681 ₪. At first it looked like growth. Then I saw \"ההפקדות שלכם 70,000\", so it's actually less than what you put in, with 500 a month at 0%.\n- **Last part I read:** \"4 מתוך 8 הבנקים… משלמים ריבית… עד ₪10,000 בלבד; הכי הרבה 3% אצל דיסקונט\". After that I stopped. I didn't read \"מי מציע ומי מפקח\" or \"כסף נכנס ויוצא\".\n\n**Where I got stuck**\n- There are two different losses: 1,797 in the sentence and 2,576 in the chart. Which one is mine? I guess one is compared with today and the other is compared with that fund, but I'm not sure.\n- The big 62,681 confused me for a moment.\n- I didn't open the fold \"חלק מהבנקים כן משלמים ריבית\".\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"קרן כספית יומית\" (sort of a fund, not really clear), מק\"מ, \"מזומן שקלי\", BANK-35 / BANK-15, \"הצגת החוקים והכללים\", \"מונח הקישו להסבר\".\n\n**What bothered me:** I came to see my own 30,000 and only got their 10,000 example. The page talks about a קרן כספית as the alternative but never told me what to actually do or where to go first. I wouldn't have closed the page in anger, but I'd leave without doing anything today."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3835,"cache_read_input_tokens":11768,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3835},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad9ad3c1-f2ac-4d3a-b1f8-1de4a6bf219e","uuid":"7c3890aa-1c9d-4b13-99f4-caf2911798c9","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:07:46.089Z","request_id":"req_011CgmeUm6SXG6LdDKAavejV"}
